// Title: Recon Information for Export with Command Prompt
// Rule ID: aa2efee7-34dd-446e-8a37-40790a66efd7
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.collection, attack.t1119
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_susp_recon.yml
//
// Generated by sigma-to-kql converter
